		{"id":"087397d4e0c9cdb8","type":"text","text":"# Ask us something\n[[Why Chai-1 as oracle rather than formula-based physical eval of energy state]]\n[[Why those probabilities for each move]]\n[[Metropolis acceptance criterion |What is beta? ]]\n[[Ligand vs binder |Difference between ligand and binder]]\n[[Why start with benzene?]]\n[[Is high affinity always the functional requirement?]]\n[[It looks like once plateau is reached (250+ moves) the MC engine is inefficient]]\n\tHow to fix it? Set higher inverse temperature, Create fine-works moveset\n","x":7000,"y":890,"width":640,"height":440}
